{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19266","headline":"早秋集贤院即事 · 刘禹锡","name":"早秋集贤院即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金数已三伏，火星正西流。\n树含秋露晓，阁倚碧天秋。\n灰琯应新律，铜壶添夜筹。\n商飙从朔塞，爽气入神州。\n蕙草香书殿，槐花点御沟。\n山明真色见，水静浊烟收。\n早岁忝华省，再来成白头。\n幸依羣玉府，末路尚瀛洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}